(7321070, 1142077, 103142, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if this was yours. I found it very evocative.  It resonated with me. Very dreamy and beautifully done.</td>', 'I was wondering if this was yours. I found it very evocative.  It resonated with me. Very dreamy and beautifully done.', '2015-02-25 13:26:47.000000', NULL, 0),
